' Rejected (EBNF v1.2.2): the FIRST swimlane declaration appears
' AFTER `start`. PlantUML's activity engine hard-rejects this with
' "This swimlane must be defined at the start of the diagram." —
' once `start` has fired in the implicit default lane, you can no
' longer introduce a swimlane structure.
'
' Subsequent lane declarations during the body (LANE CHANGES) are
' fine; only the FIRST-EVER one is constrained. Move the first
' `|...|` to BEFORE `start` to fix.
'
' Rewrite:
'   @startuml
'   |顧客|              ← first lane in prelude
'   start
'   :口座開設を申し込む;
'   |行員|              ← lane CHANGE in body — still valid
'   :申込内容を確認;
'   stop
'   @enduml
@startuml
start
|顧客|
:口座開設を申し込む;
|行員|
:申込内容を確認;
stop
@enduml
